  "onboardingWelcomeTitle": "Willkommen",
  "@onboardingWelcomeTitle": {
    "description": "Onboarding page 1 heading; German in every locale."
  },
  "onboardingWelcomeBody": "DeutschGarden teaches German from A1 to C2 — vocabulary, grammar, listening, reading, writing and speaking, in one place.\n\nEverything is already on your device. There is nothing to download as you go.",
  "onboardingOfflineTitle": "Offline, and yours",
  "onboardingOfflineBody": "No account, no sign-in, no server, no analytics. The app works with aeroplane mode on and never sends your progress anywhere.\n\nBecause nothing is stored online, your progress lives on this device only. Profile → Export makes a backup you keep.",
  "onboardingLearnTitle": "Start with Learn",
  "onboardingLearnBody": "Learn gives you one next thing to do and works out the rest — new words, reviews that are due, and repair for anything you got wrong.\n\nYou do not have to plan a session. Open Learn and answer what it puts in front of you.",
  "onboardingExploreTitle": "Explore when you want to choose",
  "onboardingExploreBody": "Explore holds the libraries: every word, story, lesson and practice game, plus the placement test if you would rather not start at A1.\n\nProfile keeps your progress, settings and backups.",
